    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal Survey is a &quot;Spot The Difference&quot; style game, look out for moving objects, objects growing in size, paintings may change, and certain other spooky events may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been hired to oversee the reporting and removal of a paranormal presence in the Parker Mansion, the Old Cathedral, and the mysterious Facility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to find all of the anomalies and simply click them to report them, be careful though, if you reach 10 active anomalies its game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 levels to observe and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulty settings (Easy, Medium, Hard)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
